          "description": "name: The name used in messages (such as upgrading), this name is not used for any GUI. cost: Resource points required each time you upgrade. scaling: This depends on what the powerup does. max-level: If you decrease the max-level, kingdoms that already upgraded that specific upgrade beyond the new value will keep their level, and it won't affect them. Unfortunately, you can't fix this unless you manually edit their data file. own-land-only: Powerups should only work in your own kingdom lands.",
